OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader says he will fight
OL,4,Aproposal to close M4 junctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Newport council says he
OL,7,Fwill fight proposals to close junctions
OL,8,Falong the M4 in the city.
OL,10,FLabour's Dimitri Batrouni said
OL,11,Fresidents of the city should not have
OL,12,Fto pay the price for attempts to ease
OL,13,Fcongestion.
OL,15,FMinisters are considering completely
OL,16,Fclosing junction 27 at High Cross, and
OL,17,Fclosing eastbound slip roads at
OL,18,Fjunction 26 in Malpas and junction 25
OL,19,Fin Caerleon as part of a package of
OL,20,Fmeasures to tackle the bottleneck at
OL,21,Fthe Brynglas Tunnels.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
