OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader says he will fight
OL,4,Aproposal to close M4 junctions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government has promised to
OL,7,Fconsult the council before going ahead.
OL,8,FDeputy Transport Minister Mark Hooper
OL,9,Fsaid keeping the current situation on
OL,10,Fthe motorway was not an option.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
